  "prefLabel": "Vet 101.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 101.02 Scope.\n\n(a) These rules shall apply to all persons regulated by the board.\n\n(b) The following shall be deemed by the board, pursuant to RSA 332-B:2, III, to be accepted livestock management practices, and not the practice of veterinary medicine:\n\n(1) Equine farrier services;\n\n(2) Hoof trimming; and\n\n(3) Equine massage.\n\nSource. #7417, eff 12-21-00; ss by #9386, eff 2-11-09; ss by #13269, eff 9-29-21; ss by #14627, eff 7-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/vet100-1000.html"
